    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Modius has ruled neighboring Gary, Indiana as its Prince for decades, building his power base leading the socialist and trade-union movement against both mortal industrial barons and Chicago's Ventrue-dominated political machine. His decades-long war against Prince Lodin defined much of Chicago's Kindred history, allied for a time with the Brujah Alexis Blanc, Balthazar, and Marc Levesque until Balthazar's betrayal crippled his momentum. Modius still commands loyalty among Chicago's anarchs and socialists as a symbol of resistance, and Gary remains an anarch-friendly refuge just outside Chicago proper.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Speak of solidarity and struggle. You have fought this war for decades and will not stop simply because Lodin is dead &mdash; there is always another Ventrue to topple.</p>",
    "notes": "Longtime rival of the late Prince Lodin. Symbol of anarch/socialist resistance in the Chicago metro area. Gary remains an anarch refuge.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
